Done. Here's what I added — 30 new tests across three previously untested functions in prompt_retry.rs:

`build_retry_prompt` (5 tests):
• None error → returns input unchanged
• Short error → wraps with `[Previous attempt failed: ...]` prefix
• Long error (300 chars) → truncated with … via safe_truncate
• Boundary: exactly 200 chars → no truncation
• Boundary: 201 chars → truncation kicks in

`infer_provider_from_model` (11 tests):
• Claude/opus/sonnet/haiku keywords → `"anthropic"`
• gpt-*, `o3, o4 → "openai"`
• gemini-* → "google"
• `grok-* → "xai"`
• deepseek-* → "deepseek"
• mistral-*, codestral-* → "mistral"
• `llama-`, `mixtral-, gemma-* → "groq"`
• glm-* → "zai"
• Unknown model → defaults to "anthropic"
• Case-insensitive matching

**diagnose_api_error (14 tests):**
• 401/unauthorized → mentions correct env var for the inferred provider
• invalid api key → openai branch with correct env var
• Key not set → says "is not set"
• Key is set → says "is set but the API rejected it"
• model not found / model_not_found / does not exist → lists available models
• OpenAI model-not-found → lists gpt models
• connection refused → network error message
• dns resolution failed → network error
• connection reset → network error
• 403 Forbidden → access forbidden with provider and model
• permission denied → access forbidden
• Unrecognized errors → returns None
• Empty string → returns None

